{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097620/extras/118fb0c4dcc1aee2a2fed8b9b06d27fe.avif?t=1761231441\" width=885 height=237 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Land on a mysterious planet and build automation systems to harness its resources and power humanity\u2019s future</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097620/extras/473f36e12282f3bdd03e5be743c8fb3e.poster.avif?t=1761231441\" width=464 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097620/extras/473f36e12282f3bdd03e5be743c8fb3e.webm?t=1761231441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097620/extras/473f36e12282f3bdd03e5be743c8fb3e.mp4?t=1761231441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything in Cartefact is a card. Gather resources, combine them to construct machines and bots, and gradually automate your production.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097620/extras/4ba6a88316029ee27c6faf4c7accfc7e.avif?t=1761231441\" width=887 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design your own factory by linking machines together into efficient assembly lines.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097620/extras/32c265a352e55f90f04e508a9c70e916.poster.avif?t=1761231441\" width=748 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097620/extras/32c265a352e55f90f04e508a9c70e916.webm?t=1761231441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097620/extras/32c265a352e55f90f04e508a9c70e916.mp4?t=1761231441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power is precious. You\u2019ll need to generate and manage energy to keep your more advanced machines running.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097620/extras/4117b9d5b4f39f10275149028c2463b4.poster.avif?t=1761231441\" width=728 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097620/extras/4117b9d5b4f39f10275149028c2463b4.webm?t=1761231441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097620/extras/4117b9d5b4f39f10275149028c2463b4.mp4?t=1761231441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade your resources to obtain Packs containing new materials to discover and exploit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097620/extras/e70caf83f2b1eef2655833acbcdd7e3a.poster.avif?t=1761231441\" width=634 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097620/extras/e70caf83f2b1eef2655833acbcdd7e3a.webm?t=1761231441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097620/extras/e70caf83f2b1eef2655833acbcdd7e3a.mp4?t=1761231441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Routers, sorting, storage, energy, liquids, waste management \u2014 every core feature of a true automation game, reimagined entirely through cards.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097620/extras/21971d9d6e2f8ee870128cca29e79591.avif?t=1761231441\" width=887 height=237 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udccf </strong>Build and automate entirely through cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f </strong>Link machines into efficient production chains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0b </strong>Manage power, logistics, and advanced resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcbc </strong>Trade to unlock new materials and technologies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude90 </strong>Explore, research, and expand your factory across an alien world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0d </strong>Uncover the secrets of the planet and find a way to solve humanity\u2019s energy crisis</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover a fresh take on the automation genre built entirely from cards.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4097620?t=1761231441","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4097620?t=1761231441","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097620/611b21067fc1cd4e156a273d7f93525976d75953/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761231441","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097620/611b21067fc1cd4e156a273d7f93525976d75953/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761231441","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descript